@participant1 
This problem is very easy to reproduce. Only insert data is written into the base table to trigger the logic of the materialized view to perform aggregation function operations (the same problem occurs when 100 pieces of data are written in the insert select rand() method). Simply executing the SQL logic of the materialized view will not reproduce this problem.

This problem occurs in both 22.3 and 23.3 versions.

